WEBVTT

00:00:00.360 --> 00:00:02.679
Shop se baahar hain, par counter dekhna

00:00:02.679 --> 00:00:05.139
hai? Chaliye, sahi camera chunne se lekar

00:00:05.139 --> 00:00:07.247
phone par live view tak dekhte hain.

00:00:07.587 --> 00:00:10.126
Pehle entry aur counter ke angles dekhte

00:00:10.126 --> 00:00:12.441
hain. Phir Wi-Fi signal aur budget ke

00:00:12.441 --> 00:00:14.308
hisaab se camera chunte hain.

00:00:14.648 --> 00:00:17.266
Camera network se jodte hain. Recording on

00:00:17.266 --> 00:00:19.739
karte hain, aur check karte hain ki entry

00:00:19.739 --> 00:00:20.902
saaf dikh rahi hai.

00:00:21.242 --> 00:00:23.744
Ab phone par live view kholiye. Shop se

00:00:23.744 --> 00:00:26.167
door reh kar bhi aap dekh sakte hain ki

00:00:26.167 --> 00:00:27.965
counter par kya ho raha hai.

00:00:28.305 --> 00:00:30.781
Purani recording chahiye? Timeline par

00:00:30.781 --> 00:00:33.039
sahi samay chuniye. Setup ke baad hum

00:00:33.039 --> 00:00:35.224
playback aur app bhi samjhate hain.

00:00:35.564 --> 00:00:38.057
Camera khareedna ya lagwana hai? Neeche

00:00:38.057 --> 00:00:41.430
contact karein. Batayein kitni jagah cover karni hai.
